WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.039
Week 36: Integrated Field Capstone. manage an unfamiliar situation brief and persuade reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan

2
00:00:09.039 --> 00:00:19.017
Mission brief. Complete the final field simulation: travel disruption, community briefing, source analysis, formal message, and recorded interview.

3
00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:28.422
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:36.203
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:44.730
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:44.730 --> 00:01:13.761
Model language. Voy a completar la simulación final del curso. — I am going to complete the course's final simulation. Resuelvo una interrupción de viaje. — I resolve a travel disruption. Doy un informe comunitario claro. — I give a clear community briefing. Hago un análisis de fuentes cuidadoso. — I do a careful source analysis. Culmino con una entrevista grabada. — I culminate with a recorded interview.

7
00:01:13.761 --> 00:01:23.659
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
